      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOMENT OF TRUTH (4) goes very well over this trip including three wins. Comes off a (19.94) win last time, scoring by 5.5 lengths in a Mix over 350m at this track. Looks a key chance on best form. MISS ME (1) was in the minors two back (20.36) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Form here at the trip sound including eight wins. Comes through a solid form race last start. Can measure up this time. LOLLIPOP VALLEY (7) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (20.22) at this track in a Grade 5 over 350m. Capable of going well again. KINGSBRAE EMMA (3) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish.",
